# 9. Production Scenario

Given:

```js
const products = [
    { id: 1, name: "Laptop", price: 60000, stock: 10 },
    { id: 2, name: "Mouse", price: 1000, stock: 0 },
    { id: 3, name: "Phone", price: 30000, stock: 5 }
];
```

### Find product with ID 2

```js
products.find(product => product.id === 2);
```

### Check if at least one is out of stock

```js
products.some(product => product.stock === 0);
```

### Check if every product is available

```js
products.every(product => product.stock > 0);
```

### Sort cheapest → expensive without mutation

```js
const sortedProducts = [...products].sort(
    (a, b) => a.price - b.price
);
```

